<title>UK: DePfa unit sets 200 million Dfl December 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa unit sets 200 million Dfl December 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Rabobank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEPFA FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    20.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.45    PAY DATE  S-03.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.875    SPREAD	+12.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   EURO</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED CURVE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
